      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The construction of a new type of vascular cuff occluder for use in conscious animals is described. This occluder has the following features: 1. Safe complete vessel occlusion. 2. Occlusion at a definite cuff pressure with extrathoracally pressure control behind the cuff. 3. Long term implantability. 4. Possibility of multiple usage and sterilization."},
